                "text": "The Inflation Reduction Act we passed last Congress continues to lower drug prices for Medicare patients across Orange County.\n\nAffordable treatments, a $35/month insulin cap, and an annual out-of-pocket cap\u2014with more to come.\nhttps://t.co/yAC8y2eJUz",
