                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Had a blast meeting Orange County seniors at the City of Santa Ana's International Older Adults Celebration earlier this month.\n\nFrom protecting Social Security to expanding Medicare benefits, I'm fighting so that older Americans can access every federal benefit they've earned. https://t.co/J56h3UoN9J",
