                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Big news for Medicare beneficiaries: Starting this year, you won\u2019t pay more than $2,000/year out-of-pocket for drugs at the pharmacy or via mail!\n\nMore than 3 million seniors across the country\u2014and here in Orange County\u2014will benefit from Medicare's new cap and Rx payment plan.",
