                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Proud to share that I'm co-sponsoring the Dental Care for Veterans Act, which would expand access to important dental care to all veterans in the VA healthcare system.\n\nToday, less than 700,000 out of 8.83 million VA enrollees can access VA dental care\u2014and that's not acceptable.",
