                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "BIG NEWS: If you\u2019re on Medicare, drug costs are coming *down* in 2026 because of President Joe Biden\u2019s Inflation Reduction Act that I was proud to vote for.\n\nMedicare must now negotiate the cost of life-saving drugs with pharmaceutical companies directly\u2014and these are the results. This is good public policy.\n\nQuestions? Call my office: (714) 559-6190",
